3- Proof of Algerian nationality (original Algerian passport, national identity card, military card with photograph). Driving license and birth certificate are not acceptable as they don't constitute an evidence of nationality;
4- Four (04) recent photographs;
5- Travel ticket;
Important notes:
1. In case the Applicant is unable to provide any of the documents mentioned above :
A certified copy of any of these documents will be required;
Declaration of two Algerian Nationals (click here to download a copy) registered at the Consulate, to confirm the Algerian nationality of the applicant.
2. Laissez-passer applications for a voluntary return should be made at least five (5) working days before the date of travel.

